      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MAJOR BYE (6) looks close to a win after finishing third in his last two appearances here, one of of them coming over this distance when he started from this barrier. Both of those were in higher-graded races. Well placed so could break through. WHATABOYJACK (1) has been competitive from tougher barriers of late and kept the ball rolling last time when he drew on the back row and 5.5 metres from the winner in fifth. Likely to get the favours from the ace draw so gets his chance. RADIANT AMBER (2) placed from the second line two back and didn't do a bad job when fourth from wider here last time out. Player from a low draw. SILENT FEARS (9) has been tackling Breeders Challenge races of late but went into that series off a win from this barrier here so is better placed.",
